creatures:
- name: Archmage
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 17  
      **Hit Points** 170 (rollable(dice=31d8 + 31,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Initiative) (16)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Arcana rollable(dice=1d20+13,label=+13,dicelabel=Arcana Check), History rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=History Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Damage Immunities** psychic  
      **Condition Immunities** charmed (with Mind Blank)  
      **Gear** wand  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 16  
      **Languages** Common plus five other languages  
      **Challenge** 12 (8,400 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +4  

      ## Traits

      ***Magic Resistance.*** The archmage has ***Advantage*** on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The archmage makes four Arcane Burst attacks.

      ***Arcane Burst.*** *Melee or Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=To Hit [Arcane Burst]), reach 5 ft. or range 150 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=4d10+5,dicelabel=Damage [Arcane Burst]) Force damage.

      ***Spellcasting.*** The archmage casts one of the following spells, using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 17):

      At will: [Detect Magic](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619097-detect-magic), [Detect Thoughts](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619099-detect-thoughts), [Disguise Self](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619102-disguise-self), [Invisibility](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619116-invisibility), [Light](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618996-light), [Mage Armor](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619006-mage-armor) (included in AC), [Mage Hand](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619008-mage-hand), [Prestidigitation](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618893-prestidigitation)  
      2/day each: [Fly](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618909-fly), [Lightning Bolt](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618999-lightning-bolt) (level 7 version)  
      1/day each: [Cone of Cold](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619042-cone-of-cold) (level 9 version), [Mind Blank](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619036-mind-blank) (cast before combat), [Scrying](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619007-scrying), [Teleport](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619163-teleport)  

      ***Misty Step (3/Day).*** The mage casts [Misty Step](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619133-misty-step), using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.

      3/day: [Misty Step](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619133-misty-step)  

      ## Reactions

      

      ***Protective Magic (3/Day).*** The archmage casts [Counterspell](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619072-counterspell) or [Shield](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619019-shield) in response to the spell's trigger, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.

      3/day: [Counterspell](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619072-counterspell), [Shield](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619019-shield)  

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Small Medium Humanoid (Wizard), Neutral*  
    **Challenge** 12
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024archmage
  status: 1

